---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | Amirhossein Eskorouchi"
  description="Professional background, capabilities, education, leadership, and recognition of Amirhossein Eskorouchi."
>
  <article class="page about-page">
    <div class="about-intro-grid">
      <header class="page-header about-header">
      <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>

      <p class="about-opening">
        Engineer by training, problem-solver by instinct.
      </p>

      <p class="page-introduction">
        I build intelligent systems for complex, real-world decisions. I care
        as much about how a solution works in practice as how it performs in an
        experiment.
      </p>

      <blockquote class="about-quote">
        <p>
          <strong>
            <em>
              &ldquo;The formulation of a problem is often more essential than
              its solution.&rdquo;
            </em>
          </strong>
        </p>

        <footer>
          <cite>Albert Einstein</cite>
        </footer>
      </blockquote>
    </header>

    <section class="content-section about-perspective">
      <h2>How I approach the work</h2>

      <p>
        My background in industrial and systems engineering shapes the way I
        approach artificial intelligence. Before selecting a model, I ask what
        decision the system should improve, what constraints matter, how success
        should be measured, and what people need in order to trust and use the
        result.
      </p>

      <p>
        I enjoy taking projects from an initially open-ended problem to a
        well-defined and usable outcome. That process may involve designing the
        data strategy, developing algorithms, organizing experiments, validating
        results, building a software prototype, and communicating the final
        system to technical and nontechnical collaborators.
      </p>

      <p>
        The most rewarding work for me happens where analytical depth and
        practical implementation meet: turning a difficult scientific or
        engineering question into something measurable, reproducible, and useful.
      </p>
    </section>
    </div>

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>Core strengths</h2>

      <div class="strength-grid">
        <article class="strength-card">
          <h3>Machine learning and computer vision</h3>
          <p>
            Designing and evaluating learning systems for classification,
            detection, visual measurement, and decision support.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="strength-card">
          <h3>Optimization and decision modeling</h3>
          <p>
            Translating operational requirements, uncertainty, and domain
            constraints into structured analytical objectives.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="strength-card">
          <h3>End-to-end system development</h3>
          <p>
            Connecting data, models, software, sensors, dashboards, and
            deployment-oriented prototypes into complete working systems.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="strength-card">
          <h3>Technical leadership and collaboration</h3>
          <p>
            Organizing interdisciplinary work, mentoring developing researchers,
            and communicating technical decisions clearly.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>Education</h2>

      <div class="education-list">
        <article class="education-entry">
          <div class="education-period">2024 to Present</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Ph.D. in Industrial and Systems Engineering</h3>
            <p>
              Mississippi State University
              <span class="education-detail">Anticipated May 2027</span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="education-entry">
          <div class="education-period">2021</div>
          <div>
            <h3>M.S. in Industrial Engineering</h3>
            <p>Iran University of Science and Technology</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="education-entry">
          <div class="education-period">2018</div>
          <div>
            <h3>B.S. in Industrial Engineering</h3>
            <p>Garmsar University</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>Professional interests</h2>

      <p class="section-introduction">
        I am especially interested in problems where a technically strong model
        must also remain reliable, interpretable, and useful under real operating
        conditions.
      </p>

      <ul class="interest-list">
        <li>
          Extracting meaningful measurements and decisions from visual data
        </li>
        <li>
          Learning effectively from limited, heterogeneous, or imperfect data
        </li>
        <li>
          Incorporating evidence, constraints, and domain knowledge into AI
        </li>
        <li>
          Connecting predictive models with optimization and decision processes
        </li>
        <li>
          Moving analytical ideas into reproducible software and usable systems
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>Teaching and mentoring</h2>

      <p>
        I view teaching and mentoring as extensions of professional leadership.
        My goal is to help students move beyond following instructions and become
        confident in framing problems, defending technical choices, and
        communicating their work.
      </p>

      <div class="detail-grid">
        <article>
          <h3>Graduate mentoring</h3>
          <p>
            Co-mentored graduate researchers on machine learning, computer
            vision, experimental design, and scholarly communication, with
            collaborations leading to peer-reviewed publications.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <h3>Undergraduate mentoring</h3>
          <p>
            Mentored five undergraduate researchers in the 2026 USDA Research
            and Extension Experiences for Undergraduates program.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <h3>Instruction</h3>
          <p>
            Delivered instruction in deep learning with PyTorch, technical
            writing with LaTeX and Overleaf, financial engineering, and financial
            risk management.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>Leadership and professional service</h2>

      <div class="detail-grid">
        <article>
          <h3>Professional leadership</h3>
          <p>
            President of the Mississippi State University INFORMS Student
            Chapter, following service as Vice President.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <h3>Community leadership</h3>
          <p>
            Vice President of the Iranian Student Association at Mississippi
            State University, following service as President.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <h3>Peer review</h3>
          <p>
            Reviewer for journals and conferences spanning artificial
            intelligence, optimization, manufacturing, sustainability, and
            engineering applications.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <h3>Conference service</h3>
          <p>
            Session Chair for a special session at the 2025 IISE Annual
            Conference and reviewer for IISE and FAIM conference programs.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>Selected recognition</h2>

      <div class="recognition-list">
        <article>
          <span class="recognition-year">2026</span>
          <p>
            <a
              href="/images/projects/plantlife365/award-certificate.png"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noreferrer"
              aria-label="Open the PlantLife365 First Place award certificate"
            >
              <strong>First Place</strong>, IISE DAIS Student Data Challenge,
              PlantLife365
            </a>
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <span class="recognition-year">2026</span>
          <p>
            <a
              href="/images/projects/wood-chip-monitor/award-certificate.png"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noreferrer"
              aria-label="Open the Wood-Chip Monitor finalist certificate"
            >
              <strong>Finalist</strong>, IISE DAIS Student Data Challenge,
              Wood-Chip Monitor
            </a>
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <span class="recognition-year">2025</span>
          <p>
            <strong>Third Place</strong>, IISE DAIS Data Analytics Competition
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <span class="recognition-year">2025</span>
          <p>
            <a
              href="/images/recognition/campus-vision-challenge-certificate.jpg"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noreferrer"
              aria-label="Open the Campus Vision Challenge Third Place certificate"
            >
              <strong>Third Place</strong>, Mississippi State University AI Club
              Campus Vision Challenge
            </a>
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section connect-section">
      <h2>Let&apos;s connect</h2>

      <p>
        I welcome conversations about applied AI, optimization, research
        collaboration, and opportunities to build useful intelligent systems.
      </p>

      <div class="connect-links">
        <a href="mailto:ae1028@msstate.edu">Email</a>
        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/amirhossein-eskorouchii/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
        >
          LinkedIn
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/amirhossein-eskorouchi"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
        >
          GitHub
        </a>
        <a href="/cv">CV &amp; Resume</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    max-width: 1320px;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .about-intro-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
    gap: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6rem);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-header {
    max-width: none;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .about-opening {
    margin: 0 0 0.45rem;
    color: var(--heading);
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 3vw, 1.75rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .about-header .page-introduction {
    max-width: 850px;
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.2rem);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .about-quote {
    max-width: 790px;
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--link);
    background: var(--soft);
    padding: 1.15rem 1.4rem;
  }

  .about-quote p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--heading);
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.12rem, 2vw, 1.28rem);
    line-height: 1.65;
    letter-spacing: 0.005em;
  }

  .about-quote strong {
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .about-quote em {
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .about-quote footer {
    margin-top: 0.45rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .about-quote cite {
    font-style: normal;
  }
  .content-section {
    max-width: 1320px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 2.65rem 0 0;
    margin-top: 2.65rem;
  }

  .content-section h2 {
    margin: 0 0 1.35rem;
    color: var(--heading);
    font-size: 1.55rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .content-section > p {
    max-width: 970px;
  }

  .about-perspective {
    max-width: none;
    border-top: 0;
    margin-top: 0;
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .strength-grid,
  .detail-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .strength-card,
  .detail-grid article {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: var(--soft);
    padding: 1.35rem 1.45rem;
  }

  .strength-card h3,
  .detail-grid h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.55rem;
    color: var(--heading);
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .strength-card p,
  .detail-grid p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .education-list {
    max-width: 970px;
  }

  .education-entry {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 145px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .education-entry:first-child {
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .education-period {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .education-entry h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
    color: var(--heading);
    font-size: 1.08rem;
  }

  .education-entry p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .education-detail {
    display: block;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .interest-list {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.75rem 2rem;
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 1.25rem 0 0;
    padding-left: 1.3rem;
  }

  .interest-list li {
    padding-left: 0.2rem;
  }

  .recognition-list {
    max-width: 970px;
  }

  .recognition-list article {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 80px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 1.25rem;
    align-items: baseline;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 0.85rem 0;
  }

  .recognition-list article:first-child {
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .recognition-year {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .recognition-list p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .connect-section {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .connect-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    margin-top: 1.3rem;
  }

  .connect-links a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border: 1px solid #a7c6eb;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: #eaf4ff;
    padding: 0.55rem 1rem;
    color: #075db8;
  }

  .connect-links a:hover {
    border-color: var(--link);
    background: #deefff;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .about-intro-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.25rem;
    }

    .strength-grid,
    .detail-grid,
    .interest-list {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .education-entry {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.2rem;
    }

    .recognition-list article {
      grid-template-columns: 62px minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }
  }
</style>
